      "text": [
        [
          "draft:how/title",
          "Know what happened?\nGet paid to report it."
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/lead",
          "Every Augur Lituus answer comes from someone with REP at stake. Report the right outcome first to earn the reward, or challenge a wrong one to win most of its bond. Taking part is optional, and a wrong call costs your bond."
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/step-1",
          "A question opens"
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/step-1-text",
          "Any app can ask a multiple-choice question and pay a fee in REP. Part of that fee rewards whoever reports the right answer, and the reward grows the longer the question waits."
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/step-2",
          "Report what happened"
        ],
